# Read by Semgrep in CI (.github/workflows/linter.yml) and by the gate (scripts/run-tests.sh).
# A .semgrepignore replaces Semgrep's built in ignore list, so that list is repeated below
# to keep everything else scanned exactly as before.

# scripts/lib/ holds BuildOS's loop scripts, copied from BuildOS and adapted (the SellOS name,
# priorities P0 to P6, the Owner field and the waiting report). The open() calls Semgrep flags are BuildOS's own,
# reading and writing TASKS.md. This is build tooling, not app code, so the Frappe app rules do
# not apply to it.
scripts/lib/

# Semgrep's built in defaults.
node_modules/
build/
dist/
vendor/
.env/
.venv/
.tox/
*.min.js
.npm/
.yarn/
test/
tests/
*_test.go
.semgrep
.semgrep_logs/
